---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: How I Can Help
permalink: /how-i-help/
---
<div class="wrapper">
  <h1 data-i18n="howihelp.heading">How I Can Help</h1>
</div>
<section class="services-grid wrapper">
  {% for service in services.list %}
  <div class="service-card">
    {% if service.icon %}<img src="{{ service.icon }}" alt="" class="service-card__icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{% endif %}
    <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ service.description | safe }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
<div class="wrapper cta-banner">
  <div>
    <h2 data-i18n="howihelp.ctaHeading">Thinking about selling?</h2>
    <p data-i18n="howihelp.ctaText">Get a free, no-obligation home value estimate to see where you stand.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/home-value/" class="cta-banner__button" data-i18n="howihelp.homeworthButton">What's My Home Worth? →</a>
</div>
<p class="wrapper how-i-help__faq-link"><span data-i18n="howihelp.faqLinkPre">Have other questions about the process? Check the</span> <a href="/faq/" data-i18n="howihelp.faqLinkMid">FAQ</a>, <span data-i18n="howihelp.faqLinkPost">or get in touch directly.</span></p>
